@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam dpi 150
left to right direction
title DGM-USECASE-05 账号认领与成果维护
actor "登录申请人" as User
actor "门户管理者" as Manager
actor "有权管理员" as Admin
rectangle "CognitaNexus" {
 usecase "UC-04 账号与会话" as Account
 usecase "UC-05 提交和查询认领" as Claim
 usecase "UC-06 审核认领" as Review
 usecase "UC-07 维护门户" as Maintain
 usecase "UC-08 确认补录与纠错成果" as Correct
}
User -- Account
User -- Claim
Manager -- Maintain
Manager -- Correct
Admin -- Review
Admin -- Maintain
Admin -- Correct
note bottom
当前V1.1；角色关系表示职责，不用继承表达账号状态。
认证及授权为守卫，不画作强制调用用例。O01/O02延期。
end note
@enduml
